# 形参所指字段的当前值（oobsum/specs/SPEC-0040）：进函数后改过（被调者拿到过指针、偏移不定的写、同类型形参的写）就不用入口符号。
#
# RUN: %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -fno-signed-char -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:InlineDepth=0 %S/Inputs/fieldcur/cur.c 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
# 写 auc / a->aucBuf 的都不能是 SAFE（原来 A、C、D 三处是错误的 SAFE）
# RUN: %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -fno-signed-char -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:InlineDepth=0 -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:ReportSafe=true \
# RUN:   %S/Inputs/fieldcur/cur.c 2>&1 | not grep -E "OOB-SAFE.*of '(auc|a->aucBuf)'"

# A：Set100(p) 之后读 p->ulLen
CHECK-DAG: cur.c:10:1: warning: [OOB-SUSPECT:type_range_only] Cannot prove the write through a 1-level call chain stays within 'auc' (16 bytes)
# C：((UINT32 *)p)[i] = 100 之后读 p->ulLen
CHECK-DAG: cur.c:20:1: warning: [OOB-SUSPECT:type_range_only] Cannot prove the write through a 1-level call chain stays within 'auc' (16 bytes)
# D：a、b 同类型，b->ulLen = 100 之后读 a->ulLen
CHECK-DAG: cur.c:24:1: warning: [OOB-SUSPECT:type_range_only] Cannot prove the write through a 1-level call chain stays within 'a->aucBuf' (16 bytes)
# 对照：调用之前读的、只读的形参、不同类型的形参——仍按入口值推到调用方
CHECK-DAG: cur.c:29:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 2-level call chain: up to byte 32 of 'auc' (16 bytes) is accessed
CHECK-DAG: cur.c:33:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 2-level call chain: up to byte 32 of 'auc' (16 bytes) is accessed
CHECK-DAG: cur.c:38:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 2-level call chain: up to byte 32 of 'auc' (16 bytes) is accessed
